# gtar's testpad reports whether tar's header struct needs a pad byte; every
# object in that tree includes its output, and nobody had run it.  gtar itself
# still does not build -- cpp bus-errors on tar.c, the same defect as flex.
# See notes/CPP-MACRO-CRASH.md.
